<title>USA: Maine Housing Auth restructured, maturity added.</title>
<headline>Maine Housing Auth restructured, maturity added.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it revised its repricing by adding a 2028 maturity.</p>
<p>The restructure follows:</p>
<p>MAINE STATE HOUSING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $30,000,000*</p>
<p>MORTGAGE PURCHASE BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES C-1 (NON-AMT)</p>
<p>1997 SERIES C-2 (AMT)</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC.</p>
<p>REVISED REPRICE/RESTRUCTURE.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE THE ADDITION OF THE 2028 C-2 MATURITY.</p>
<p>WE WILL CONSIDER ALL ORDERS IN 2030 GOOD IN 2028.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING OF THE 2015 C-1, 2004-2006 C-2</p>
<p>MATURITIES.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>NO NEW ORDERS WILL BE ACCEPTED.</p>
