<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, June 4, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on June 26, 1997.</p>
<p>The bonds will not be blue skyed in the following states: IA,</p>
<p>MN, MT, NV, NH,</p>
<p>NM, ND, RI, SD, VT, WA AND WI.</p>
